<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 30 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 30 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 30 in New York on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of 29-5/8 and the day's high of 30.</p>
<p>Volume was 115,500 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 76,200.</p>
<p>It previous close on Tuesday was 30. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
